:"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/78484/season/2/episode/36"},{"id":"1875463","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"nazuma Japan is still playing a match against Perfect Spark but Perfect Spark is down two players after Froy Girikanan and Viktor Sedov left their team.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-07-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/78484/season/2/episode/37"},{"id":"1875464","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After their battle with Perfect Spark, the members of Inazuma Japan are disheartened. On the other hand, Asuto, who woke up in a certain person's room, learns about the Orion Foundation's original form.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-07-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/78484/season/2/episode/38"},{"id":"1875465","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Episodio 39","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Asuto and the others vow to wake up the Disciples of Orion, a new member appears. They were excited about playing against the supposedly non-Orion France, when...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-07-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/78484/season/2/episode/39"},{"id":"1875466","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Episodio 40","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In order to look into the incident concerning the French team, Froy and Ichihoshi head to Bernard, the chairman of the Orion Foundation and Froy's older brother. On their way here, Froy tells Ichihoshi about the Bernard he respected. According to him, Bernard had changed after a certain incident.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-07-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtim