r arms and legs that increases the strength of their movements and techniques. Because of that, Inazuma Japan struggle against them and are quickly behind with a score of 0-2. How will Inazuma Japan turn this match around?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-08-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/78484/season/2/episode/44"},{"id":"1918548","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Episodio 45","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"During the match against the Italian team, Inazuma Japan's face distrusts the anomalies in the opponent's body. Inamori Asuto of Inazuma Japan desperately asks them to stop the dangerous game...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-08-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/78484/season/2/episode/45"},{"id":"1926635","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Inazuma Japan continue their match against Guardians of Queen but the score isn't in favor for Inazuma Japan, being 1-3.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-09-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/78484/season/2/episode/46"},{"id":"1934787","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Inazuma Japan are finally faced with the FFI finals. The members make certain feelings of wanting a fair match against the reborn Russia representatives.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-09-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mhCc9weinxCPBQJEvHPT3hISYIp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mhCc9weinxCPBQJEvHPT3hISYIp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/78484/season/2/episode/47"},{"id":"1935414","seasonNumber